1e Day &amp; Night Shifts</strong><br>\u2022 Clock in for different shifts and face changing item types, speeds, and challenges.  <br>\u2022 Night shifts might just bring some... <i>unusual</i> materials.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Eco-Impact System</strong><br>\u2022 Track your progress with the Eco-Impact Meter. Feel good knowing your work makes a difference (and maybe earns a bonus too).  <br>\u2022 Avoid contamination by staying sharp, trash in the wrong bin ruins your streak!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8b9d6322b0b706cc0c97605ecc45e23b.poster.avif?t=1769164166\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8b9d6322b0b706cc0c97605ecc45e23b.webm?t=1769164166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8b9d6322b0b706cc0c97605ecc45e23b.mp4?t=1769164166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udcbc Upgrade &amp; Expand</strong><br>\u2022 Earn money to unlock better tools, faster machines, and smarter sorting tech.  <br>\u2022 Turn your humble work station into a streamlined recycling empire.<br><br><strong>Trash or treasure? It's all in a day's shift.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/63973a1e40e57b7f956f5aa9d515fea9.avif?t=1769164166\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>","developers":["Rogue Duck Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/0601ba75249422bd0e50e3823811d9bf39de1e3d/header.jpg?t=1769164166","is_free"